3 settings were chosen, so this replay is IN SAMPLE: the tail widths, poll weight and prior weights were tuned on it. The special-vote shift uses 2017 only.","counted is the share of voting-place results released, not the share of votes. Preliminary night counts exclude special votes (16-21% of the vote).","No map: the electorate boundaries of this election are not published here.","Model settings: configs/nz2026_v3.toml (docs/newzealand_v3.md). Retrospective replay, not pre-registered."],"n_units":72}